          "toFrame": 4790,
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080,
          "fps": 30
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_012",
        "content": "那账上有没有要盯的地方？",
        "dur": 3.4,
        "durationSource": "measured",
        "url": "http://10.20.130.251:8080/media/49362baa-6e06-441e-8b6f-6a262e795a53/45888b04-449b-47bb-9e6f-70d07d443ec2/12.mp4",
        "extraData": {
          "kind": "scene",
          "sha256": "87b9ae1094c3e8d0d511170aa7d24db990e1437433fe0f3f6251fc223f38b417",
          "fromFrame": 4790,
          "toFrame": 4892,
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080,
          "fps": 30
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_013",
        "content": "有三处。应收账款占收入14.7%，跟去年的14.4%持平，回款节奏基本稳定。研发再投资率从19.1%降到16.7%，每赚一块钱毛利投回研发的钱比去年少。账面没有商誉，没有并购留下的减值风险。",
        "dur": 22.7,
        "durationSource": "measured",
        "url": "http://10.20.130.251:8080/media/49362baa-6e06-441e-8b6f-6a262e795a53/45888b04-449b-47bb-9e6f-70d07d443ec2/13.mp4",
        "extraData": {
